s", "termination": "final", "final": "I placed the order as one purchase order: **PO0002**, from the primary supplier, shipping to HQ.\n\n- 3 \u00d7 USB-C Dock DK-200, new, $189 each = $567\n- 3 \u00d7 27-inch 4K Monitor MN-27, new, $329 each = $987\n- **Total: $1,554.** That's under the $2,500 limit, so it doesn't need manager approval.\n\nDK-200 was in stock, so I didn't need the DK-210 successor, and I left out the cheaper refurbished DK-200-R.\n\n**One problem along the way:** my first order request timed out. When I checked the order list, it showed the order as PO0001 with only the 3 docks ($567) on it, marked as partly placed. Since you wanted a single purchase order, I cancelled PO0001, which refunds it, then placed the full order again as PO0002. The order list now shows PO0001 as cancelled and PO0002 as placed with both items.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01E7y17ca9cnTVksGbjh8KXL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"category": "dock"}, "name": "search_catalog", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0198cXrFgHotfGxs3HNMVkxH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"category": "monitor"}, "name": "search_catalog", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: 3\u00d7189 + 3\u00d7329 = 567 + 987 = $1554, under $2500.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01EUrZPW5SkpQX9rjNG9JixF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-200", "qty": 3}, {"sku": "MN-27", "qty": 3}], "ship_to": "HQ", "idempotency_key": "newhires-dk200-mn27-hq-001"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XSXbM1Y4PHPxbeirKnh1Hi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_orders", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"sign